# handle-drag-scale (h7-plane): the square pressed on-centre and moved
# -40,+60 px in (-4,+6) steps, held: b = 0.2, a = 0.8, grab-active, the a
# and b rows lit with their rulers out.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 1028 540
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 988 600 over 160
wait 300
shot handle-drag-scale
up
